137	// briefConsolidation is the compact, task-relevant projection of a dossier the
138	// brief carries: enough to act (trigger, workflow, verification, failure modes)
139	// plus one anchor and the trust signals (confidence, verdict, staleness).
140	type briefConsolidation struct {
